sequenceDiagram
    participant browser as React browser
    participant cognito as Cognito hosted login
    participant api as API Gateway JWT authorizer
    participant backend as ApiBackend
    participant data as DynamoDB / Cognito groups
    browser->>cognito: Authorize: code + state + S256
    cognito->>browser: Callback: code + matching state
    browser->>cognito: Exchange code + PKCE verifier
    cognito->>browser: Access / ID / refresh tokens
    browser->>api: Bearer access token
    api->>backend: Validated principal + claims
    backend->>data: Role/owner check; current operator
    backend->>browser: Authorized result or rejection
